Open GPU DB
Copyright 2026 onepunk

This product includes data from the dbgpu project by Benjamin Paine:
https://github.com/painebenjamin/dbgpu

dbgpu is licensed under the MIT License. Its bundled dataset is derived from
the TechPowerUp GPU Database (https://www.techpowerup.com/gpu-specs/). The
imported dataset, its exact tool version, checksum, and retrieval date are
recorded in data/imports/dbgpu/metadata.json.

Open GPU DB adds normalization, stable identifiers, aliases, official
vendor corrections and additions, field-level provenance, validation, and
generated artifacts. See README.md for the layering model.
